{"lines":[{"c":1,"x":0.098594004827267892,"w":0.12174203236897786,"t":"Audioscripts","y":0.069090153070496152,"h":0.017342949362890714},{"t":"over the world go by. The oldest buildings in the area are on the main streets, including the","y":0.11238623891584243,"h":0.017874675027332865,"x":0.10275252431199543,"w":0.71834620157877604,"c":1},{"t":"city's first department store, built in the 1880s, which is still open today.","y":0.12916627473070941,"c":1,"w":0.56608103434244794,"h":0.018871833073376698,"x":0.10069395156623709},{"h":0.018429338300186004,"t":"The Sheepmarket is a centre for fashion, and there's a policy of encouraging new young","c":1,"w":0.70182698567708335,"x":0.10073303434219365,"y":0.15145200680952942},{"x":0.10275267087020221,"w":0.73687276204427077,"y":0.16633603632162608,"h":0.018315876330587955,"t":"designers. The Young Fashion competition is open to local young people who are passionate","c":1},{"h":0.018276075311487783,"c":1,"x":0.10068895184125533,"w":0.69982172648111973,"y":0.18191405948337325,"t":"about fashion. This year they've been asked to design an outfit based on ideas from the"},{"t":"Q13","y":0.18168604679220235,"x":0.85390946593276307,"w":0.037037035624186143,"h":0.013081394460653373,"c":1},{"h":0.018287829431684388,"t":"music and technology that's part of their everyday life, using both natural and man-made","x":0.10070111185549413,"c":1,"y":0.1976845068931401,"w":0.70394185384114583},{"y":0.21349090110792446,"x":0.10279098861001898,"w":0.70182306925455729,"t":"fibres. The garments will be judged by a panel of experts and fashion designers, and the","c":1,"h":0.017513969902155369},{"x":0.10072712561277868,"c":1,"t":"winning entries will be modelled at a special gala evening.","y":0.22952199764982428,"w":0.46518091837565106,"h":0.017806846205281168},{"w":0.72862187703450521,"h":0.017992272393863473,"x":0.10481730688977735,"c":1,"t":"Parking at the Sheepmarket is easy. There are plenty of pay and display car parking spaces","y":0.25124279493797785},{"c":1,"y":0.26689451798009445,"t":"on the roadsides which are fine if you just want to stay for an hour or two, but if you want","x":0.10480323543416697,"w":0.70192520141601555,"h":0.017793448709908066},{"w":0.70814575195312501,"t":"to spend the day there it's better to park in one of the four underground car parks. It's not","y":0.28128931930042311,"x":0.10273081270420505,"h":0.019144711983077434,"c":1},{"h":0.018304422690815003,"x":0.10277898215802508,"w":0.79035771687825529,"c":1,"y":0.29776819907527985,"t":"expensive and if you can present a receipt from one of the local stores, you'll not be charged Q14"},{"x":0.10273324668816382,"t":"at all. After six pm many of the car parks have a flat rate which varies but it is usually very","w":0.71219619750976559,"y":0.31286516383239893,"h":0.019618692611496735,"c":1},{"x":0.10485537472198746,"c":1,"t":"reasonable.","y":0.33249428123930214,"w":0.096873613993326821,"h":0.012337018519604781},{"t":"The Sheepmarket is one of the main centres for art and history in the whole of the country.","c":1,"h":0.017922041413359957,"w":0.71217885335286457,"x":0.10686972250464616,"y":0.36715842100165086},{"h":0.019458361873918806,"x":0.10684640353552367,"y":0.38182350939840259,"c":1,"w":0.72251576741536461,"t":"it you look at our map, youll see some of the main attractions there. Most visitors start from"},{"h":0.021349719331739014,"c":1,"x":0.10478223530759929,"y":0.39667005466042315,"w":0.73285380045572912,"t":"Crawley Road, at the bottom of the map. The Reynolds House is one of the oldest houses in"},{"x":0.10478754049792627,"y":0.41268706495717178,"w":0.73690973917643232,"c":1,"h":0.019021960956047801,"t":"the city, and is open to the public. It's on the north side of Crawley Road, next to the footpath"},{"t":"that leads to the public gardens.","c":1,"h":0.013081395583944722,"x":0.1028806569780259,"y":0.43313953475508127,"w":0.25925926208496092},{"x":0.10479058418974281,"w":0.79042195638020829,"h":0.020264712042746713,"c":1,"t":"The area's particularly interesting for its unusual sculptures. 'The Thumb' is just what its name Q16","y":0.45075504103438702},{"t":"suggests, but it's about 10 metres high. You'll see it on Hill Road, across the road from the","x":0.10480417549629246,"w":0.7224224853515625,"y":0.46744872867566545,"h":0.018390260119039326,"c":1},{"w":0.051440327962239601,"c":1,"h":0.013081395583944722,"t":"Bank.","x":0.10493827212019316,"y":0.48837209287455585},{"c":1,"h":0.01846641814610428,"t":"The Museum's got a particularly fine collection of New Zealand landscapes. It's on the east","y":0.50552133086120277,"w":0.72659830729166663,"x":0.10479527842565205},{"y":0.50581395324000444,"c":1,"w":0.037037035624186143,"t":"Q17","h":0.013081395583944611,"x":0.85802469222905908},{"c":1,"y":0.52065609744468766,"w":0.69983311971028639,"t":"side of the Sheepmarket, on City Road. It's on the other side of the road from the public","x":0.10480579402703635,"h":0.019386983451349038},{"t":"gardens, immediately facing the junction with Hill Road.","y":0.53873421397612797,"w":0.44458592732747393,"x":0.1048560775317957,"h":0.0165471918310518,"c":1},{"t":"The Contemporary Art Gallery is on a little road that leads off Station Square, not far from the","c":1,"y":0.55948069759608887,"h":0.018942129766421512,"w":0.74507634480794271,"x":0.10481865042769187},{"h":0.011778563015312105,"x":0.84773662585386322,"y":0.56095406349167143,"c":1,"w":0.049382715225219642,"t":"_ Q18"},{"t":"public gardens. The road ends at the gallery - it doesn't go anywhere else. That's open every","c":1,"x":0.10683117152816844,"w":0.7430938212076823,"y":0.57477185327435265,"h":0.021054823912495912},{"h":0.01564896541995342,"c":1,"t":"day except Mondays.","x":0.10886424366794351,"y":0.59365659836677909,"w":0.1731774012247721},{"x":0.10685739373615472,"t":"The Warner Gallery specialises in 19th-century art. It's on City Road, near the junction with","y":0.61382442309456642,"w":0.72249389648437501,"h":0.018938174657743057,"c":1},{"t":"Q19","x":0.86008230513634543,"w":0.037037035624186254,"h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1,"y":0.61482558123932052},{"x":0.108968737889291,"t":"Crawley Road, on the same side of the road as the public gardens. It's open on weekdays","y":0.62992468436925597,"c":1,"h":0.017302365971397893,"w":0.71414891560872396},{"y":0.64811542990444482,"t":"from 9 to 5, and entry is free.","h":0.016195524146054185,"c":1,"x":0.10699588706432436,"w":0.23456789652506513},{"y":0.66676849537701743,"x":0.10892630632185331,"t":"Finally, if you're interested in purchasing high quality artwork, the place to go is Nucleus. You. Q20","w":0.79037770589192713,"c":1,"h":0.019651569101358346},{"w":0.73677536010742184,"y":0.68386928051940088,"t":"need to go from Crawley Road up through Station Square and east along Hill Road until you","x":0.10896982206351367,"c":1,"h":0.017282908881089631},{"w":0.72452550252278647,"h":0.019589986902243672,"c":1,"y":0.69848214024950284,"t":"get to a small winding road turning off. Go up there and it's on your right - if you get to City","x":0.10891397866065934},{"c":1,"h":0.015260551506554698,"x":0.10888632193071852,"y":0.71778726086074018,"t":"Road you've gone too far.","w":0.20813353220621744},{"x":0.11111111290889725,"w":0.15432098388671872,"t":"SECTION 3","h":0.016195524146054074,"y":0.76737338053897253,"c":1},{"x":0.10886218597755905,"y":0.79108673865246315,"w":0.66089736938476562,"c":1,"t":"KATIE: Joe, you know I'm giving a presentation in our film studies class next week?","h":0.02083811630770227},{"h":0.021856074338807319,"c":1,"t":"KATIE: Well, could we discuss it? I could do with getting someone else's opinion.","x":0.10886740840701663,"y":0.8219623391174522,"w":0.64232538859049482},{"x":0.16445611067023275,"y":0.83856936210735189,"c":1,"t":"Of course, Katie. What are you going to talk about?","w":0.41188153584798176,"h":0.019660071293232106},{"w":0.71631266276041661,"y":0.85300057214510627,"t":"KATIE: It's about film adaptations of Shakespeare's plays. I've got very interested in all the","c":1,"x":0.1089263712548319,"h":0.020182365803892655},{"h":0.01453830777405285,"w":0.35390945434570309,"t":"different approaches that film directors take.","x":0.16666667204589847,"y":0.8720930231138434,"c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.032921810150146488,"t":"JOE:","x":0.11111111127503757,"h":0.010174418787512463,"y":0.89098837196246017},{"t":"Uhuh.","x":0.16666666717769055,"c":1,"y":0.88953488357364607,"w":0.051440327962239546,"h":0.013081395583944722},{"y":0.94331395332993895,"c":1,"t":"112","w":0.037037035624186213,"h":0.013081395583944722,"x":0.11316872488338016},{"t":"leltsresources.org","x":0.3946972034900052,"y":0.96586933515588835,"w":0.20856304168701173,"h":0.018369355667887111,"c":1}],"w":2400,"h":3395}